        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 63904, Traditional Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, this mortise handleset is made with the sophisticated detailing that makes the traditional style so alluring. Made by Omnia, the 63904 Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is available in either polished brass, polished chrome, or satin nickel finishes in a wide array of functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry. The Traditional Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2\" or 2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available Matching <a href=\"/products/classic-solid-brass-leverset-omnia-904-00\"><b>Classic Solid Brass Leverset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Narrow Backset Handleset With Classic Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid brass with a heavy gauge plated steel case.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass 1/2\" lachbolt and 1\" deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" keyway (for key functions).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 1-1/2\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x lip 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" x 3/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" x 1\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Case:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-13/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN_narrow_bs_mortise_dimentions.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Narrow Backset Mortise Lock Specification Diagram</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Narrow Backset Handleset with Classic Lever, Omnia 63904",
                "description": "Made out of solid brass, this mortise handleset is made with the sophisticated detailing that makes the traditional style so alluring. Made by Omnia, the 63904 Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is available in either polished brass, polished chrome, or satin nickel finishes in a wide array of functions including single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry. The Traditional Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches.",
                "keywords": "small backset locksets, omnia narrow backset mortise locks, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, OMN-63904, Omnia 63904, Traditional Narrow Backset Handlesets, Traditional Narrow Backset Mortise Locksets, narrow backset handlesets, Traditional handlesets, classic handlesets, Traditional entrance sets, Traditional mortise entrancesets, Traditional front door handles,"
